# swift signals, over kill(2) in the linked `signal-sender` runtime shim. Internal: reached only through the public
# process/signal API, which has already ruled out an id that is not one process and a signal with no number.

# The dock ALIAS is the global's own name, `signal-sender`. The shim file is runtime/signal-sender.<ext>
dock load
  load <global:signal-sender>, name signal-sender

task signal-process
  take id, like number
  take number, like number
  like boolean
  send back
    call signal-sender/send
      read id
      read number
